{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "أَخَذْنَا", "translation": "We took"}, {"text": "مِيثَـٰقَ", "translation": "(the) covenant"}, {"text": "بَنِىٓ", "translation": "(from the) Children"}, {"text": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translation": "(of) Israel"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "تَعْبُدُونَ", "translation": "you will worship"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَبِٱلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ", "translation": "and with [the] parents"}, {"text": "إِحْسَانًۭا", "translation": "(be) good"}, {"text": "وَذِى", "translation": "and (with)"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ", "translation": "relatives"}, {"text": "وَٱلْيَتَـٰمَىٰ", "translation": "and [the] orphans"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَسَـٰكِينِ", "translation": "and the needy"}, {"text": "وَقُولُوا۟", "translation": "and speak"}, {"text": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translation": "to [the] people"}, {"text": "حُسْنًۭا", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "وَأَقِيمُوا۟", "translation": "and establish"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "translation": "the prayer"}, {"text": "وَءَاتُوا۟", "translation": "and give"}, {"text": "ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ", "translation": "the zakah"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "تَوَلَّيْتُمْ", "translation": "you turned away"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "قَلِيلًۭا", "translation": "a few"}, {"text": "مِّنكُمْ", "translation": "of you"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُم", "translation": "and you (were)"}, {"text": "مُّعْرِضُونَ", "translation": "refusing"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We took the covenant from the Children of Israel, [enjoining upon them], \"Do not worship except Allāh; and to parents do good and to relatives, orphans, and the needy. And speak to people good [words] and establish prayer and give zakāh.\" Then you turned away, except a few of you, and you were refusing."}